WEBVTT

00:01:27.904 --> 00:01:30.409
We did everything we could

00:01:30.409 --> 00:01:32.318
to stop al Qaeda

00:01:32.318 --> 00:01:35.603
and the foreign fighters that
came in as suicide bombers

00:01:35.603 --> 00:01:40.718
and as accelerants to the violence.

00:01:40.718 --> 00:01:42.740
We honed our combat skills,

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:45.576
we developed new equipment,

00:01:45.576 --> 00:01:48.030
we parachuted, we helicoptered,

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:50.488
we took small boats, we drove, and we walked

00:01:50.488 --> 00:01:53.498
to objectives night after night to stop

00:01:53.498 --> 00:01:58.850
the killing that this network was putting forward.

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:01.390
We bled,